# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of a contributor's
# local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows' common
# `core.autocrlf=true` global default silently checks every text file out
# with CRLF line endings, which every ESLint/Prettier config in this repo
# (both apps/api and apps/web) rejects as a `prettier/prettier` "Delete
# `␍`" error — on a fresh Windows clone this makes `npm run lint` fail
# with thousands of line-ending-only errors across virtually every file,
# none of them a real defect.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never go through EOL normalization.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.svg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
